{"id":"c7ab6c8e893872fb","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-inference-rule.md","title":"Inference Rule","display":"df-inference-rule — Inference Rule","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-inference-rule","aliases":["88-df-inference-rule"],"display":"df-inference-rule — Inference Rule","depends_on":["[[88-df-formula]]","[[88-df-godel-numbering]]","[[88-df-decidable-set]]","[[88-df-encoding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-inference-rule"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-inference-rule</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-inference-rule — Inference Rule"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"56061e16f3fb8bfd\" href=\"?note=56061e16f3fb8bfd\" title=\"88-df-godel-numbering\">88-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a6c52aed1a56207b\" href=\"?note=a6c52aed1a56207b\" title=\"88-df-decidable-set\">88-df-decidable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> (formula set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> (candidate rule relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\\)</span> (inference-rule predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{Fml}_S^m\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{Fml}_S^m\\)</span> (finite premise lists)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RuleCode}_g(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{RuleCode}_g(R)\\)</span> (coded rule-application relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffRule}_{S,g}(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{EffRule}_{S,g}(R)\\)</span> (effective-rule predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Godel}_S(g)\">\\(\\mathrm{Godel}_S(g)\\)</span> (Gödel-numbering predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"56061e16f3fb8bfd\" href=\"?note=56061e16f3fb8bfd\" title=\"88-df-godel-numbering\">88-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Decidable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Decidable}\\)</span> (decidable-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a6c52aed1a56207b\" href=\"?note=a6c52aed1a56207b\" title=\"88-df-decidable-set\">88-df-decidable-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Coding}(\\mathrm{enc})\">\\(\\mathrm{Coding}(\\mathrm{enc})\\)</span> (finite-tuple coding, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inference\\text{-}rule}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{Fml}_S^m\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inference\\text{-}rule}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{Fml}_S^m\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inference\\text{-}rule}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\n\\leftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_S\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inference\\text{-}rule}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\n\\leftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inference\\text{-}rule}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RuleCode}_g(R)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathrm{enc}(g(\\langle\\vec\\varphi\\rangle),g(\\psi)):\n(\\vec\\varphi,\\psi)\\in R\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inference\\text{-}rule}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RuleCode}_g(R)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathrm{enc}(g(\\langle\\vec\\varphi\\rangle),g(\\psi)):\n(\\vec\\varphi,\\psi)\\in R\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inference\\text{-}rule}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EffRule}_{S,g}(R)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\\land\\mathrm{Godel}_S(g)\n\\land\\mathrm{Coding}(\\mathrm{enc})\n\\land\\mathrm{Decidable}(\\mathrm{RuleCode}_g(R))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inference\\text{-}rule}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EffRule}_{S,g}(R)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\\land\\mathrm{Godel}_S(g)\n\\land\\mathrm{Coding}(\\mathrm{enc})\n\\land\\mathrm{Decidable}(\\mathrm{RuleCode}_g(R))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\frac{\\varphi_1, \\ldots, \\varphi_n}{\\psi}\">\\(\\frac{\\varphi_1, \\ldots, \\varphi_n}{\\psi}\\)</span> : 推理规则形式 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>常见推理规则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>分离规则（Modus Ponens）：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\frac{\\varphi, \\varphi \\rightarrow \\psi}{\\psi}\">\\(\\frac{\\varphi, \\varphi \\rightarrow \\psi}{\\psi}\\)</span></li>\n<li>概括规则：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\frac{\\varphi}{\\forall x \\varphi}\">\\(\\frac{\\varphi}{\\forall x \\varphi}\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>不在假设中自由出现）</li>\n<li>合取引入：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A, B}{A \\land B}\">\\(\\frac{A, B}{A \\land B}\\)</span></li>\n<li>合取消去：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A \\land B}{A}\">\\(\\frac{A \\land B}{A}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A \\land B}{B}\">\\(\\frac{A \\land B}{B}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>第一定义只把规则定型为“有限前提表—结论”的关系，允许零前提规则。\n第二谓词才要求编码后的规则应用可判定；可靠性与完备性仍须另外证明。</p>\n<p>相关概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"86a742fad2207b40\" href=\"?note=86a742fad2207b40\" title=\"88-df-derivation\">88-df-derivation</a>：推理规则的应用形成推导</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"def3025c6c81c740\" href=\"?note=def3025c6c81c740\" title=\"88-df-theory\">88-df-theory</a>：推理规则定义系统</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9\" href=\"?note=b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9\" title=\"88-df-provable\">88-df-provable</a>：推理规则的最终产物</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e14624569ca2194b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":